  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\n\nThis game was developed as part of the CopStone proposal, designed
    specifically for constellation exploration. The game interface is simple yet
    functional, with each button serving a specific role to enhance the gameplay
    experience.\r\n\r\nThe journey begins with a storyline video that sets the stage
    for the adventure. Once the video concludes, the main menu appears, offering
    four buttons: Game, Lesson, Settings, and Exit. Clicking the Game button reveals
    a selection of four constellation groups: Northern Hemisphere, Western Hemisphere,
    Southern Hemisphere, and Eastern Hemisphere. Each group consists of 10 levels,
    with each level providing detailed information about the constellations visible
    in the corresponding hemisphere. Players must complete all levels within a group
    to unlock the next set of constellations.\r\n\r\nThe Lesson section offers an
    educational video that deepens the player's understanding of the constellations
    within each group. In the Settings menu, players can adjust sound and music levels
    to their preference. The About section, also found in Settings, provides a guide
    on how to use the different buttons. The Exit button, conveniently located at
    the bottom left of the main menu, allows players to leave the game at any time.\n                                 
    \n  Welcome"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
